  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_dazzle_1_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes all abilities.</font></b> \n\n New Passive Ability: Good Juju \n\n Using items triggers, after 0.5s, an area under the hero that deals Pure Damage per second to enemies: 50 + 1.5%/2.5%/3.5% of Max Health \n\n Radius: 300 \n Duration: 4s \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'> Does not work on toggleable items. </font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_1_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes all abilities.</font></b> \n\n New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Good Juju</font></b> \n\n Using items triggers, after 0.5s, an area under the hero that deals Pure Damage per second to enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>1.5%</font></b>/2.5%/3.5% of Max Health \n\n Radius: 300 \n Duration: 4s \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'> Does not work on toggleable items. </font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_1_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes all abilities.</font></b> \n\n New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Good Juju</font></b> \n\n Using items triggers, after 0.5s, an area under the hero that deals Pure Damage per second to enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> + 1.5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2.5%</font></b>/3.5% of Max Health \n\n Radius: 300 \n Duration: 4s \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'> Does not work on toggleable items. </font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_1_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes all abilities.</font></b> \n\n New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Good Juju</font></b> \n\n Using items triggers, after 0.5s, an area under the hero that deals Pure Damage per second to enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> + 1.5%/2.5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3.5%</font></b> of Max Health \n\n Radius: 300 \n Duration: 4s \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'> Does not work on toggleable items. </font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_2_0": "Reduce Item Cooldown: 15%/30%",
    "modifier_dazzle_2_1": "Reduce Item Cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>/30%",
    "modifier_dazzle_2_2": "Reduce Item Cooldown: 15%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b>",
