    "modifier_dazzle_15_0": "Shadow Wave can be cast on enemies. \n\n Shadow Wave can bounce to enemies. \n\n Shadow Wave Healing and Damage Increase: 10%/15%/20% of Max Mana",
    "modifier_dazzle_15_1": "Shadow Wave can be cast on <b><font color='#eabe10'>enemies</font></b>. \n\n Shadow Wave can <b><font color='#eabe10'>bounce</font></b> to enemies. \n\n Shadow Wave Healing and Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/15%/20% of Max Mana",
    "modifier_dazzle_15_2": "Shadow Wave can be cast on <b><font color='#eabe10'>enemies</font></b>. \n\n Shadow Wave can <b><font color='#eabe10'>bounce</font></b> to enemies. \n\n Shadow Wave Healing and Damage Increase: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>/20% of Max Mana",
    "modifier_dazzle_15_3": "Shadow Wave can be cast on <b><font color='#eabe10'>enemies</font></b>. \n\n Shadow Wave can <b><font color='#eabe10'>bounce</font></b> to enemies. \n\n Shadow Wave Healing and Damage Increase: 10%/15%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b> of Max Mana",
    "modifier_dazzle_16_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Shallow Grave</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Healing Step \n\n Hero teleports to the indicated point using the Shadow Wave. \n\n Range: 450 \n Cooldown: 18 seconds \n Mana Cost: 75",
    "modifier_dazzle_16_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Shallow Grave</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Healing Step</font></b> \n\n Hero teleports to the indicated point using the <b><font color='#eabe10'>Shadow Wave</font></b>. \n\n Range: 450 \n Cooldown: 18 seconds \n Mana Cost: 75",
    "modifier_dazzle_17_0": "Healing Step Cooldown Reduction: 2/4/6 seconds \n\n Increased Range of Healing Step: 50/100/150",
    "modifier_dazzle_17_1": "Healing Step Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/4/6 seconds \n\n Increased Range of Healing Step: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b>/100/150",
    "modifier_dazzle_17_2": "Healing Step Cooldown Reduction: 2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/6 seconds \n\n Increased Range of Healing Step: 50/<b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>/150",
    "modifier_dazzle_17_3": "Healing Step Cooldown Reduction: 2/4/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b> seconds \n\n Increased Range of Healing Step: 50/100/<b><font color='#eabe10'>150</font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_18_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Poison Touch</font></b> \n\n Every 3rd use of Healing Step will not trigger the cooldown. \n\n Additional Spell Range: 150",
    "modifier_dazzle_18_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Poison Touch</font></b> \n\n Every <b><font color='#eabe10'>3rd</font></b> use of Healing Step will not trigger the cooldown. \n\n Additional Spell Range: <b><font color='#eabe10'>150</font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_19_0": "Shadow Wave Slows Enemies: 20%/40% \n\n Duration: 2 seconds",
    "modifier_dazzle_19_1": "Shadow Wave Slows Enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>/40% \n\n Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_dazzle_19_2": "Shadow Wave Slows Enemies: 20%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b> \n\n Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> seconds",
