    "modifier_dazzle_20_2": "Status Resistance: 7%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>14%</font></b>/21% \n\n Mana: 200/<b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b>/600",
    "modifier_dazzle_20_3": "Status Resistance: 7%/14%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>21%</font></b> \n\n Mana: 200/400/<b><font color='#eabe10'>600</font></b>",
    "modifier_dazzle_21_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Nothl Projection </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Bad Juju \n\n This ability can be cast to reduce the cooldowns of other abilities at the cost of Health. Casting this ability temporarily increases its Health cost. \n\n Ability Cooldown Reduction: 2 sec. \n Health Cost Increase per Cast: 30% \n Health Cost Duration: 20 sec. \n Health Cost: 75",
    "modifier_dazzle_21_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Nothl Projection </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Bad Juju</font></b> \n\n This ability can be cast to reduce the cooldowns of other abilities at the cost of Health. Casting this ability temporarily increases its Health cost. \n\n Ability Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> sec. \n Health Cost Increase per Cast: 30% \n Health Cost Duration: 20 sec. \n Health Cost: 75"
